# =============================================================================
# Webhooks - Admin Subscriptions API Smoke Tests
# =============================================================================

### Create webhook subscription – success (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "event": "order.placed",
  "url": "https://example.com/webhook",
  "secret": "whsec_test",
  "maxRetries": 3
}

### List webhook subscriptions – success (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/subscriptions?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get webhook subscription by ID – not found (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/subscriptions/{{nonExistentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create webhook subscription – no auth (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/subscriptions
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "event": "order.placed",
  "url": "https://example.com/webhook",
  "secret": "whsec_test"
}
